## Installation

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="bash"}
---
code: |
  pnpm add @talex-touch/tuffex
---
:::

:::TuffCodeBlock{lang="typescript"}
---
code: |
  import { TxButton, TxSplitButton, TxIconButton, TxCopyButton } from '@talex-touch/tuffex/button'
  import '@talex-touch/tuffex/button/style.css'
  import '@talex-touch/tuffex/base.css' // tokens + resets, once per app
---
:::

