## Use cases

- Page and card actions, form submits (`nativeType="submit"`), and drawer footers (`block`).
- Table rows and toolbars (`size="sm"`), and icon-only actions (`circle` or `TxIconButton`).
- A primary action with a menu of variants (`TxSplitButton`), and copy-to-clipboard (`TxCopyButton`).
